/*==================================================
              DESIGN NOTES
==================================================*/

PASSAGE NAMING

StoryInit
Startup

Ch1_Opening
Ch1_Bedroom
Ch1_Breakfast
Ch1_Street
Ch1_Market

NPC_Yasmina
NPC_Qadir
NPC_Sultan

Combat_[EnemyName][##]

UI_Sidebar

------------------------------------------------

RELATIONSHIP SCALE

-25 Enemy
0   Stranger
10  Friendly
25  Friend
50  Trusted
75  Love
100 Soulmate

------------------------------------------------

PERSONALITY

Honor
Curiosity
Discipline
Faith
Mercy

------------------------------------------------

WRITING RULES

Every passage should:
• Advance the plot
• Reveal character
• Build the world

Every scene should leave one memorable impression.

No exposition dumps. No purple prose. No generic fantasy dialogue.

Descriptions emphasize smell, sound, texture, and atmosphere before visual spectacle.

Player choices shape personality and relationships first, plot structure second.

The central storyline remains focused — choices open doors, not branches of the main plot.


